"help.restore.body" = "Open Photos and find Recently Deleted. Items normally remain there for 30 days. Choose the items and recover them. PhotoSweep cannot recover permanently deleted items. iCloud Photos syncs deletion and recovery across devices.";
"help.permission.title" = "Missing photos?";
"help.permission.body" = "Check photo access in iPhone Settings. With limited access, only selected items appear. iCloud originals may require an internet connection when you open or compress them. Library analysis does not automatically download every original.";
"help.privacy.title" = "Your photos stay yours.";
"help.privacy.body" = "PhotoSweep analyzes the photos and videos you allow on your device. Your photos, filenames and photo identifiers are not sent to the developer. There are no third-party advertising or analytics SDKs. Apple handles purchases and iCloud transfers. Sorting decisions and settings stay in the app’s local database; deleting the app removes those records.\n\nOperator: Koki Egawa\nSupport: photosweep.support@gmail.com";
"help.terms.title" = "Using PhotoSweep";
"help.terms.body" = "Free sorting includes 30 photos and 5 videos per day. Pro adds unlimited sorting, date filters and supported SDR video compression. Prices and any eligible trial are shown from the App Store before purchase. Subscriptions renew unless cancelled in Apple subscription settings; lifetime purchases do not renew. Compression may change quality. Check the output before deleting an original. Deleted data size does not guarantee an equal increase in free storage. Formal operator details must be completed before store release.";
